ruments\talso classified\tin\tLevel\t3\tof\tthe\tfair-value\thierarchy.\tThe\teffects\tof\tthese\thedges\tare presented\tgross\tin\tthe\tfollowing\ttables.\n\n|  |  | Net\trealized/unrealized | Net\trealized/unrealized | Transfers | Purchases, |  | Unrealized |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  |  | gains\\t(losses)\\tincluded\\tin | gains\\t(losses)\\tincluded\\tin | in\\tand/or | issuances |  | gains |\n|  | December\\t31, | Principal |  | out\\tof | and | December\\t31, | (losses) |\n| In\\tmillions\\tof\\tdollars | 2007 | transactions | Other\\t^(1)\\t(2) | Level\\t3 | settlements | 2008 | still\\theld^(3) |\n| Assets |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Securities\\tpurchased\\tunder\\tagreements\\tto\\tresell | $16 | $— | $— | $— | $(16) | $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t— | $\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t— |\n| Trading\\taccount\\tassets |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Trading\\tsecurities\\tand\\tloans | 75,573 | (28,052) | — | 7,418 | (4,166) | 50,773 | (19,572) |\n| Derivatives,\\tnet\\t^(4) | (2,470) | 7,804 | — | (2,188) | 440 | 3,586 | 9,622 |\n| Investments | 17,060 | — | (4,917) | 5,787 | 10,343 | 28,273 | (801) |\n| Loans | 9 | — | (15) | — | 166 | 160 | (19) |\n| Mortgage\\tservicing\\trights | 8,380 | — | (1,870) | — | (853) | 5,657 | (1,870) |\n| Other\\tfinancial\\tassets\\tmeasured\\ton\\ta\\trecurring\\tbasis | 1,171 | — | 86 | 422 | (1,320) | 359 | 86 |\n| Liabilities |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Interest-bearing\\tdeposits | $56 | $(5) | $— | $13 | $(20) | $54 | $(3) |\n| Securities\\tsold\\tunder\\tagreements\\tto\\trepurchase | 6,158 | (273) | — | 6,158 | (1,422) | 11,167 | (136) |\n| Trading\\taccount\\tliabilities |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Securities\\tsold,\\tnot\\tyet\\tpurchased | 473 | 153 | — | 1,036 | (703) | 653 | 328 |\n| Short-term\\tborrowings | 5,016 | 106 | — | (1,798) | (1,783) | 1,329 | (63) |\n| Long-term\\tdebt | 8,953 | 2,228 | — | 38,792 | (34,319) | 11,198 | 1,115 |\n| Other\\tfinancial\\tliabilities\\tmeasured\\ton\\ta\\tr